# ATS-214 :: the Next.js 16 static export build
#
# WHY IT WAS MEASURED ON THE D: DRIVE
# ------------------------------------
# The Turbopack build resolves `next/package.json` INSIDE the filesystem
# root it is given (apps/studio). A JUNCTION to the dependency tree on
# another volume is not resolved by it -- the build fails with "Could
# not find the Next.js package (next/package.json)" even though the file
# is reachable through the junction. The build therefore ran on a copy
# of THIS TREE on D:, where apps/studio/node_modules is a real directory
# (a copy of the repository's own examples/sample-playwright
# dependency tree, the same one the other evidence collectors use).
#
# The sources in the D: tree are THIS TASK'S sources, byte for byte
# (the same files that are committed on the task branch):
#   apps/studio/app/page.tsx, apps/studio/app/globals.css,
#   apps/studio/lib/api.ts, apps/studio/public/case-search.mjs,
#   apps/studio/public/fallback.html
#
# The build includes the TypeScript check, so the type errors the new
# code would cause are caught here.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
npm notice run @ai-test-studio/ui@0.1.0 build
npm notice run next build
